{
  "name": "Day 07 Solution: Webhooks & APIs 101",
  "description": "Three parallel HTTP Request calls: unauthenticated JSONPlaceholder, query-param API-key auth (OpenWeatherMap), and a deliberate 404 for comparison.",
  "tags": [
    "week-01",
    "day-07",
    "solution"
  ],
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sticky1",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        40,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 07 Solution: Webhooks & APIs 101\n\nThree HTTP Request chains from one Manual Trigger: (1) unauthenticated JSONPlaceholder GET, (2) query-param API-key auth against OpenWeatherMap, (3) a deliberate 404 against a mistyped URL, so you can compare a real 401/404 side by side. Credentials needed: OpenWeatherMap free API key to get real data back from Call 2 (it will 401 without one, which is also useful to see).\n\nSee DAILY_TASKS/DAY_07_Webhooks_APIs_101.md.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 480
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "trigger1",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        80,
        140
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "http1",
      "name": "Get Public Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        320,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "set1",
      "name": "Extract Post Stats",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        560,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "total_posts",
              "value": "={{ $json.length }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "first_post_title",
              "value": "={{ $json[0].title }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "http2",
      "name": "Get Weather (API Key Auth)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        320,
        180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://api.openweathermap.org/data/2.5/weather",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "q",
              "value": "London"
            },
            {
              "name": "appid",
              "value": "your_openweathermap_api_key"
            },
            {
              "name": "units",
              "value": "metric"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "set2",
      "name": "Format Weather",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        560,
        180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "city",
              "value": "={{ $json.name }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "temperature",
              "value": "={{ $json.main.temp }}°C"
            },
            {
              "name": "description",
              "value": "={{ $json.weather[0].description }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "http3",
      "name": "Deliberate 404 (Bad URL)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        320,
        340
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/nonexistent-path",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "set3",
      "name": "Log 404 Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        560,
        340
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "status_code",
              "value": "={{ $json.statusCode || 404 }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "note",
              "value": "404 = wrong URL/path, distinct from a 401 auth failure"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Manual Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Get Public Data",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Get Weather (API Key Auth)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          },
          {
            "node": "Deliberate 404 (Bad URL)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Get Public Data": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Extract Post Stats",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Get Weather (API Key Auth)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Format Weather",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Deliberate 404 (Bad URL)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Log 404 Response",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
